1
00:00:02,752 --> 00:00:08,683
Working with a team. Organizations, invitations, private goals and comments

2
00:00:09,215 --> 00:00:15,819
An organization's goals are shared with its members. Create one with New organization.

3
00:00:15,923 --> 00:00:20,228
Open an organization to see its members and invite people.

4
00:00:20,347 --> 00:00:28,623
Click Invite member, enter their email, and pick a role. Members work on the goals. Admins also manage members.

5
00:00:28,727 --> 00:00:35,587
GoalNexa doesn't send the email. Click Copy link, and send it yourself. The link works for two weeks.

6
00:00:36,550 --> 00:00:42,562
Pending invitations can be copied again or revoked. Let's revoke this demo one.

7
00:00:42,675 --> 00:00:46,342
To make a goal private, open it, and go to Sharing.

8
00:00:52,308 --> 00:00:57,589
Public means the whole organization. Private means only you and the members you add.

9
00:00:57,718 --> 00:01:03,173
Under Activity, the team sees who checked in what, and can comment next to the numbers.
